        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Explosive Decay"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(necromancy, negative, occult)\n\nWhen a mulventok dies, its mirrored flesh ruptures and explodes in a 20-foot radius. Creatures caught in the blast are covered with viscera and take 8d6 negative damage (22 basic Reflex save)."
            },
            "id": "5e8e30b8-c2c3-4e07-a22b-266869c358ed",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:00.567924"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "War Leader"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, mental)\n\nA mulventok's fervor inspires its allies. Allies within 30 feet that can see or hear the mulventok gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls and skill checks as long as their actions don't impede the mulventok's imprinted purpose.\n\nItems +1 tamchal chakram (page 73), steel shield (Hardness 5, HP 20, BT 10)"
            },
            "id": "d2c03e91-56a3-4b74-b13b-f66a87d7cd47",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:00.567924"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Psychokinetic Honing"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(occult, transmutation)\n\nA thrown weapon gains the effects of a returning rune when a mulventok throws it. Thrown weapons the mulventok uses deal an additional 1d6 mental damage, whether used in melee or thrown."
            },
            "id": "3cbd2ae2-367b-4686-8417-8cb77592612c",
            "updated_at": {
